{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, fall, and rise again on this journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait with us on your wishlist \ud83d\udc39</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008550/extras/7bcc7afbafc5a501237e4f1b2b8b913a.poster.avif?t=1766735004\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008550/extras/7bcc7afbafc5a501237e4f1b2b8b913a.webm?t=1766735004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008550/extras/7bcc7afbafc5a501237e4f1b2b8b913a.mp4?t=1766735004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008550/extras/8df9cdaf0939310071f567b26c37c5b5.avif?t=1766735004\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008550/extras_big/8df9cdaf0939310071f567b26c37c5b5.webp?t=1766735004 width=1560 height=439 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hamstory</strong> is a <strong>2D pixel platformer</strong> where heartfelt emotion meets thrilling challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Hamcho on a journey to Haessi Star,<br>where you'll gather strength to leap forward, sometimes fall, and rise again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Falling isn't failure\u2014it's part of growing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat with warm-hearted animal friends, listen to their stories,<br>and discover the true meaning of challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leap Toward What's Next!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold the jump button to charge up, then release at just the right moment to soar.<br>You might fail sometimes, but that's okay.<br>Each attempt teaches you something that'll carry you higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes the path ahead is visible, but how to reach it isn't so clear.<br>When that happens, pause for a moment and map out possible routes.<br>Try them one by one, and you'll find your own answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008550/extras/d2e449fba78c327776ce92916450699f.poster.avif?t=1766735004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008550/extras/d2e449fba78c327776ce92916450699f.webm?t=1766735004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008550/extras/d2e449fba78c327776ce92916450699f.mp4?t=1766735004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Journey with Animal Friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even when you fall, it's okay. The townsfolk's warm encouragement is always there for you.<br>Help them with their requests to learn new jump techniques<br>and uncover the stories hidden in their lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008550/extras/61bf41e54ef272289cf0f7972b86d112.poster.avif?t=1766735004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008550/extras/61bf41e54ef272289cf0f7972b86d112.webm?t=1766735004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008550/extras/61bf41e54ef272289cf0f7972b86d112.mp4?t=1766735004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heartfelt Pixel Art</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every pixel was lovingly placed by hand, with detailed animations<br>bringing a world of tiny lives to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008550/extras/927e7ae4630bacd8c7708a18eabe6c98.poster.avif?t=1766735004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008550/extras/927e7ae4630bacd8c7708a18eabe6c98.webm?t=1766735004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008550/extras/927e7ae4630bacd8c7708a18eabe6c98.mp4?t=1766735004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World Alive with Seasons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hamstory's journey flows with the changing seasons.<br>Experience a transforming world through maps and effects<br>that renew with each season.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008550/extras/dc306ad867429e00523be94e58e6325a.poster.avif?t=1766735004\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008550/extras/dc306ad867429e00523be94e58e6325a.webm?t=1766735004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008550/extras/dc306ad867429e00523be94e58e6325a.mp4?t=1766735004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>We're Cheering You On!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until you reach Haessi Star,<br>fall and leap again and again, and create your own story.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4008550?t=1766735004","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4008550?t=1766735004","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008550/cb3586e83f7089377980c90f335375380c6de600/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766735004","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008550/cb3586e83f7089377980c90f335375380c6de600/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766735004","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4088390,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, fall, and rise again on this journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait with us on your wishlist \ud83d\udc39</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008550/ex